  "rootCauses": [
    "Independent DINO prompt grounding confidences were incorrectly compared as species confidence; a cat region scored fox above cat.",
    "The pinned Gemma tokenizer did not apply SigLIP2 lowercase preprocessing; explicit lowercase was required.",
    "Image-image and text-image raw cosine distributions differ; a common raw threshold and arithmetic combined score were not calibrated for these modalities."
  ],
  "changes": [
    "Union of original fixed DINO prompts proposes boxes; shared SigLIP2 class bank classifies deduplicated crops, including fixed rejection labels.",
    "Explicit lowercase, fixed length 64 and normalized vectors; actual uppercase/lowercase same sentence now yields identical vectors.",
    "Calibration-only monotonic sigmoid for each modality, fixed 0.5 gate; combined requires both gates on the same crop then geometric mean."
  ],
